					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					507e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς κ. τε καὶ ὁμιλίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
