				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					343d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν γυναικῶν κ. τοῖς
			ἀνδράσι</span>, viz. co-education, ib.<i><span class="en">
